join matilda left
set {matilda.spoke} = true
- Are you Matilda?
matilda: Yes I am.
matilda: And...
matilda: Who would you be?
- I'm a reporter.
	set {matilda.reporter_reveal} = true
	matilda: A reporter?!
	matilda: I don't have anything to say to you!
	matilda: SCRAM!
	[end_timeline]
- An old friend of Anthony's.
	matilda: You seem a little young to be an "old friend."
	- I look young for my age.
		matilda: Hm. Alright.
		jump reconvene
	- I knew him when I was eight.
		matilda: Are you the same age as Casper, then?
		- Yes! We went to school together.
			matilda: I see. But you were friends with Anthony...?
			matilda: Not Casper?
			matilda: A boy your own age?
			- I was an eccentric youth.
				matilda: Hm. Alright.
				jump reconvene
label reconvene
- It's been a while since I've thought about Anthony. Do you mind...
	- refreshing me on what happened?
		matilda: He went missing. That's it. Nothing else to say about it.
		matilda: I think this conversation is over.
		[end_timeline]
	- telling me your favorite memory with him?
		matilda: Oh.
		matilda: Oh, I suppose I could.
		matilda: Anthony loved to travel. We would sit in his study together and he would spin his globe. I would point at a spot... we'd make an itinerary. We never had enough time to travel, with Casper being so young...
		matilda: I did love Anthony. I think people think I didn't, but I did.
		matilda: Oh, goodness! Why am I telling you this? I don't know you at all! And with Will in the other room!
		set {matilda.know_will} = true
		[end_timeline]